      "quote": "Item B-1.8: Excavating trenches of required width for pipes cables etc. ... depth up to 1.5 Mtr. ... > ORDINARY ROCK: -"
    }
  ],
  "answer": "The basic rate for excavating a trench for a pipe of 150 mm diameter (which falls in the 80 mm–300 mm range) in ordinary rock up to 1.5 m depth is Rs 429 per metre [S3]. Because the trench depth is 2.5 m, which is between 1.5 m and 3 m, the extra percentage of 104 % from Item B‑1.9 applies [S1]. The total rate per metre is therefore:\n\nRs 429 × (1 + 104 %) = Rs 429 × 2.04 = Rs 875.16 per metre.\n\nThus, the applicable rate is Rs 875.16 per metre for the described trench.",
  "missing": ""
}

